{"unit_id":"DIPPER12138__dsh-mathtype#card-zh","repo":"DIPPER12138/dsh-mathtype","commit":"9f4ca194a56a569817badfcb7f9a3bfd9d6ee4b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mathtype 是面向 DSH 桌面配置的 MathType 文档工具，可将 Word .docx 中的 LaTeX 占位公式转换为 MathType OLE 对象。插件启动时会注册 mathtype 技能；转换器支持行间、带编号及行内公式，通过 Word 自动化编辑文档，并保留原有编号、SEQ 字段、书签和交叉引用。它还提供转换前扫描、输出结构验证和可选 PDF 检查，适合需要将论文公式整理为 MathType 格式的用户。需要 Windows、桌面版 Word、MathType 7 和匹配位数的 Python 3.10+ 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/startup.js:96-134","skills/mathtype/scripts/convert_docx.py:20-35","skills/mathtype/scripts/convert_docx.py:269-345","skills/mathtype/SKILL.md:10-25"]}
